{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54187","headline":"道院迎仙 · 皮日休","name":"道院迎仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百尺丹台倚翠华，洞门迢递隔烟霞。\n雨中白鹿眠芳草，松下青牛卧落花。\n幽谷月明浮紫气，瑶池水暖伏丹沙。\n抛书亦欲寻真去，安得相从一饭麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}